{
  "slug": "contextstellar",
  "name": "Contextstellar",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Context engineering plugin for Claude Code — real-time prompt scoring, RLM adaptive weights, and token optimization. Scores every tool use across 5 dimensions (token utilization, structural clarity, specificity, content density, cache-friendliness) and learns optimal weights for your project.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `optimize` (Analyze recent prompt patterns and suggest optimizations), `score` (Score a prompt for context engineering quality), `setup` (Set up ContextStellar cloud mode for RLM learning and dashboards), `stats` (Show ContextStellar scoring statistics, RLM learning progress, and grade distribution for the current project)\n- **Hooks** (3): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install contextstellar@claude-community` from `sunnypatneedi/claude-code-contextstellar`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
